302	 * and that both children of every node have equal black-height; *count is
303	 * incremented once per real (non-NIL) node visited. Returns this
304	 * subtree's black-height, or -1 if a violation was found anywhere in it --
305	 * the -1 sentinel short-circuits back up through the recursion without
306	 * further checks once a violation is found. */
